Third-Party Dependencies (preliminary)

This is a preliminary inventory of third-party packages referenced via NuGet by
the distributable Cirrus components (including the `az` CLI, `cirrus-agent`, the
`az-tui` dashboard, and the `Cirrus.*` PowerShell modules). It exists to aid pre-release review only. The authoritative NOTICE must
be generated with Component Governance against the built artifacts, which captures
the full (transitive) dependency tree and the complete license text for each
component. Names, versions, and licenses below reflect the declarations on `main`
and are subject to change.

Scope notes:

- Test-only and benchmarking dependencies are excluded. For example,
  BenchmarkDotNet, Microsoft.PowerShell.SDK, and Microsoft.ApplicationInsights are
  referenced only by tests/Benchmark and are not distributed.
- npm packages under wiki/ (medium-zoom, mermaid, vitepress,
  vitepress-plugin-mermaid) are devDependencies used only to build the
  documentation site and are not distributed, so they are excluded.
- System.Management.Automation is referenced with PrivateAssets="all" and is
  provided by the PowerShell host at runtime rather than redistributed.
- AI capabilities are provided by calling the Azure OpenAI service through
  Microsoft SDKs; no third-party AI model is bundled or distributed with Cirrus.

